{"title":"My New Jersey history podcast with “Exit Interviews”","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/945958412/0/marginalrevolution~My-New-Jersey-history-podcast-with-Exit-Interviews.html","date":1770823071000,"content":"<p>Exit Interviews is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.njexitinterviews.com/\" target=\"_blank\">a new podcast run by David Piegaro</a>.  I am honored to be one of the first few guests, along with Chris Christie.  Think of this session as “Tyler Cowen as regional thinker.”  Almost 100% fresh material, not to mention some trolling directed at Central and South Jersey, Philly too.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.njexitinterviews.com/episodes/tyler-cowen\" target=\"_blank\">my episode</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Definitely recommended, and let us hope that David Remnick gets on soon to defend the honor of River Vale vs. Hillsdale in Bergen County…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/my-new-jersey-history-podcast-with-exit-interviews.html\">My New Jersey history podcast with “Exit Interviews”</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/945958412/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/945958412/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/945958412/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/945958412/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/945958412/marginalrevol